<title>USA: General Mills Inc Q1 Aug 25 net off.</title>
<headline>General Mills Inc Q1 Aug 25 net off.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.80		    $0.86</p>
<p> Oper net		 126,900		  136,900</p>
<p> Revs		   1,315,600		1,276,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 157,900		  158,400</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Current year Q1 oper shr and oper net exclude unusual after-tax charge of $29.2 million, or $0.18 per share, on accounting change. Net after charges would be $97.7 million, or $0.62 per share.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
